Content-Type: application/json
NGSILD-Snapshot: urn:ngsi-ld:Snapshot:Frozen
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.9.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"; type="application/ld+json"
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)

{
  "id": "urn:ngsi-ld:Vehicle:V1",
  "speed": [
    {
      "instanceId": "REGEX(.*)",
      "instanceId": "REGEX(.*)",
      "type": "Property",
      "value": 42
    },
    {
      "instanceId": "REGEX(.*)",
      "instanceId": "REGEX(.*)",
      "type": "Property",
      "value": 50
    },
    {
      "instanceId": "REGEX(.*)",
      "instanceId": "REGEX(.*)",
      "type": "Property",
      "value": 55
    }
  ],
  "type": "Vehicle"
}



06. GET /temporal/entities (multi) with NGSILD-Snapshot — frozen view
=====================================================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
